    {
      "bbox": [
        228,
        1638,
        1804,
        1850
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "At the request of the Mayor, therefore, I am requesting that you submit no later than November 14, 1973, the following information to Milton Musicus, Chairman of the Mayor's Inter-departmental Committee on Public Utilities, Room 1800 Municipal Building, New York, N.Y. 10007:",
